WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.101
-Thank you very much!

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.903
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."
Thank you so much.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.971
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:05.971 --> 00:00:08.374
Well, guys, the election
is just a week away,

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.944
but the White House is making
news for all the wrong reasons.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.345
Take a look.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.615
-Concerns of another coronavirus
outbreak at the White House,

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:18.618
after five of Vice President
Mike Pence's associates,

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:22.455
including his chief of staff,
test positive for COVID-19.

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.891
The Vice President campaigning
in North Carolina,

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:27.259
a move defended
by White House officials,

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:29.461
who called him
an essential worker.

00:00:29.461 --> 00:00:30.930
-Even Joe Biden is like,
"Trust me.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.233
Being Vice President
is not essential work."

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.268
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.070
That's right.
The coronavirus is spreading

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.772
through
the coronavirus task force.

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:42.542
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.511
But don't worry --
the White House is now forming

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:47.580
a task force to figure out what
went wrong with the task force.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.149
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:50.683
Yep, the only place
the coronavirus

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.486
is rounding the corner is in the
halls of the White House.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:55.721
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:57.623
Seriously, it doesn't instill
a lot of confidence

00:00:57.623 --> 00:01:00.059
that the head of the
coronavirus task force's office

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.560
got the coronavirus.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.730
It's like if the Avengers
got mugged.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.032
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:08.501
Meanwhile, when Pence saw he was
trending online, he was like,

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.303
"Oh, no. Do I have
another fly on my head?"

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:11.571
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.373
That's right,
Pence will continue to campaign,

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:16.743
'cause not even COVID
can stop people from seeing

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.345
the electricity
and raw sexual magnetism

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:22.915
that is Mike Pence in person.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:25.084
That's right, five members
of Mike Pence's staff

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:27.653
tested positive for coronavirus.

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:29.389
Pence himself tested negative,

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:32.091
but he did go through
a contact-tracing program.

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.860
We actually got the audio from
the phone call with his doctor.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.229
Listen to this.

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.446
-There you go.
Well, interesting.

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:28.580
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.716
Interesting that
we got that audio.

00:02:30.716 --> 00:02:32.151
And this didn't help.
Yesterday, White House

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:34.787
chief of staff Mark Meadows
got a lot of attention

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.723
for what he said about
controlling the virus.

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:37.890
Watch this.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.526
-So here's what we have to do.

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:41.861
We're not going
to control the pandemic.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:45.364
We are going to control the fact
that we get vaccines,

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:47.099
therapeutics,
and other mitigations --

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:49.068
-Why aren't we gonna get
control of the pandemic?

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.437
-The White House has said,
"It is what it is,

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:53.540
and we are not
going to control it."

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.476
They talk about COVID like
it's a wild teen on "Dr. Phil."

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.843
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.843 --> 00:02:59.012
"We're out of ideas.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.747
Hopefully this thing
calms down with age."

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.181
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.850
It's like the coronavirus
won the Super Bowl,

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.552
except it already made trips to
Disneyland and the White House.

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:07.953
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.953 --> 00:03:09.288
Well, the White House
isn't alone.

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:11.256
Fox News is also dealing
with their own outbreak.

00:03:11.256 --> 00:03:12.591
Listen to this.

00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:15.027
-"The New York Times" reports
the president of Fox News

00:03:15.027 --> 00:03:16.863
and several of the channel's
top anchors,

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.765
including Bret Baier
and Martha MacCallum,

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:20.566
they have been advised
to quarantine.

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:23.202
They were exposed to the virus
on a flight to Nashville

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:26.238
for last Thursday's
final presidential debate.

00:03:26.238 --> 00:03:28.174
-Dang.
First, Pence's inner circle

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:30.109
gets COVID and now Trump's.

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:32.411
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.411 --> 00:03:34.747
I hope none of the anchors
on Fox News have the virus,

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.682
'cause if you think
Sean Hannity's intense now,

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:38.184
imagine him on steroids.

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:39.451
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.451 --> 00:03:40.953
But this was nice.
Trump called to check

00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:43.022
on everyone,
then spent the next 55 minutes

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:44.557
ranting about windmills.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:45.858
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:48.328
They say if anyone's acting
disoriented or lethargic,

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:50.229
don't worry --
that's just Lou Dobbs.

00:03:50.229 --> 00:03:53.565
-The caravan of mostly
Central American immigrants

00:03:53.565 --> 00:03:56.368
is now in the Mexican City
of "Wach-la-da" tonight.

00:03:56.368 --> 00:04:00.339
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:02.541
-Oh, Lou, come on.

00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:05.511
We're almost done showing that.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:07.347
Get this --
the Trump administration

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:10.149
did have a plan
for a COVID vaccine.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:12.051
Check out who they wanted
to give it to.

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:15.821
-Santa And Mrs. Claus will not
be getting an early vaccine.

00:04:15.821 --> 00:04:18.157
The Department of Health and
Human Services is dropping

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:21.593
a holiday ad campaign
that would have offered

00:04:21.593 --> 00:04:23.963
Santa Claus performers,
along with Mrs. Claus

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.398
and elf performers,
early access to a vaccine

00:04:26.398 --> 00:04:29.402
in exchange for promoting
the benefits to the public.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:31.403
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.403 --> 00:04:33.106
-That was their plan?

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:35.174
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:37.043
Mall Santas?

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:39.578
Yeah, 'cause before making
any important medical decisions,

00:04:39.578 --> 00:04:42.081
I wanna hear what a drifter
with whiskey breath has to say.

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:45.017
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.017 --> 00:04:47.987
Seriously, nothing says
"trustworthy" quite like a man

00:04:47.987 --> 00:04:50.723
sitting outside a Hot Topic,
asking you to sit on his lap.

00:04:50.723 --> 00:04:52.058
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:53.926
Have you ever seen a mall Santa?

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:56.195
Coronavirus is like 10th
on the list of things

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:57.196
they need vaccines for.

00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:59.131
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.131 --> 00:05:01.533
Speaking of the holidays,
Halloween is almost here,

00:05:01.533 --> 00:05:03.469
and last night, the Trumps
hosted trick-or-treaters

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:05.104
at the White House,
where they were greeted

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:07.807
by two kids
who dressed up like them.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:09.208
Look that.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:11.477
Well, at least one Trump
is wearing a mask.

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:13.045
[ Laughter, groans ]

00:05:13.045 --> 00:05:14.313
But this was crazy.
At one point,

00:05:14.313 --> 00:05:16.382
Trump fled to his bunker
when he saw a little girl

00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:17.850
dressed as Lesley Stahl.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.718
[ Laughter ]

00:05:19.718 --> 00:05:21.320
Yep, this Halloween party
was a little different.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:24.423
Instead of candy, Trump was
handing out unapproved vaccines.

00:05:24.423 --> 00:05:25.824
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.824 --> 00:05:27.493
I hope everyone had a good time
'cause I don't think

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:30.530
Melania's next event
will be quite as fun.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:33.265
Yeah, exactly.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.265 --> 00:05:35.334
Some more political news --
this weekend, Russian president

00:05:35.334 --> 00:05:37.503
Vladimir Putin was asked about
Joe Biden's family.

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:38.737
Check it out.

00:05:38.737 --> 00:05:41.207
-Russian President
Vladimir Putin isn't going along

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:43.275
with one of President Trump's
campaign attacks

00:05:43.275 --> 00:05:45.177
on Joe Biden's son.

00:05:45.177 --> 00:05:47.380
On state television,
Mr. Putin said he doesn't see

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.415
anything criminal
in Hunter Biden's past

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:52.184
business ties
with Ukraine or Russia.

00:05:52.184 --> 00:05:55.721
-2020 -- where Vladimir Putin
is somehow the voice of reason.

00:05:55.721 --> 00:05:56.955
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.955 --> 00:05:59.058
Even Putin is distancing
himself from Trump.

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:01.160
He's like,
"Donald is too much drama,

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.196
like a Real Housewife
of Volgograd.

00:06:04.196 --> 00:06:08.367
Volgograd.
Real Housewife of Volgograd."

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:11.704
[ Laughter ]

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:14.540
Putin was like,
"Terrible, terrible conspiracy.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.610
I give it one out of five
poison syringes."

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.445
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:20.880
Here's a big story.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.515
Today, the Senate voted to
confirm Judge Amy Coney Barrett

00:06:23.515 --> 00:06:25.518
to the Supreme Court.
Take a look.

00:06:25.518 --> 00:06:30.590
-On this vote, the yeas are 52,
the nays are 48.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:34.393
The nomination of
Amy Coney Barrett of Indiana

00:06:34.393 --> 00:06:37.496
to be an associate justice of
the Supreme Court

00:06:37.496 --> 00:06:40.066
of the United States
is confirmed.

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:41.600
-Yeah, Republicans haven't
moved that fast

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.469
since they saw A.O.C.
in the hallway.

00:06:43.469 --> 00:06:45.304
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:47.373
Let's change gears.
I heard about a Walmart

00:06:47.373 --> 00:06:49.408
in Oklahoma
that had to be evacuated

00:06:49.408 --> 00:06:51.077
after an unexpected visitor
walked in.

00:06:51.077 --> 00:06:52.245
Watch this.

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:55.648
-And an Edmond Walmart
shuts down after a skunk

00:06:55.648 --> 00:06:57.916
runs loose inside the store.

00:06:57.916 --> 00:07:00.887
Experts say the skunk was stuck
in the shoe department.

00:07:00.887 --> 00:07:02.522
[ Laughter ]

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:04.623
-I never told anybody this,
but for years,

00:07:04.623 --> 00:07:06.993
I toured in a country band
named Walmart Skunk.

00:07:06.993 --> 00:07:08.060
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.695
It was even more strange
when a customer

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:10.762
ran down the aisle like,

00:07:10.762 --> 00:07:12.498
"Hubert,
get back on your leash!"

00:07:12.498 --> 00:07:14.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.435
When the skunk walked past
the Axe Body Spray aisle,

00:07:16.435 --> 00:07:18.004
it was like,
"Ugh! What is that?"

00:07:18.004 --> 00:07:20.205
[ Laughter ]

00:07:20.205 --> 00:07:23.275
I wonder what could've attracted
wild animals into a Walmart.

00:07:23.275 --> 00:07:25.811
-KFC is bringing back
it's collaboration with Walmart

00:07:25.811 --> 00:07:28.981
to offer the fried-chicken
scented fire log again.

00:07:28.981 --> 00:07:31.383
-Mmm.

00:07:31.383 --> 00:07:33.486
-If Trump gets re-elected,
that'll be the smoke

00:07:33.486 --> 00:07:35.187
that comes out
of the White House chimney.

00:07:35.187 --> 00:07:36.288
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.288 --> 00:07:37.723
I'm kidding.
But that's what they light

00:07:37.723 --> 00:07:39.892
at the Vatican
when the Pope wants a 12-piece.

00:07:39.892 --> 00:07:41.327
[ Laughter ]

00:07:41.327 --> 00:07:44.229
The KFC log sounds fun until
your dog jumps onto the fire.

00:07:44.229 --> 00:07:47.700
-Aww!
[ Laughter ]

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.036
-I'm a little --
I'm a little classier myself.

00:07:50.036 --> 00:07:52.638
I prefer a
Boston Market-scented fire log.

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:55.441
[ Laughter ]

00:07:55.441 --> 00:07:56.842
So...

00:07:56.842 --> 00:08:01.180
[ Laughter ]

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.281
And finally, here's an update

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:03.916
to a story
we told you about last week.

00:08:03.916 --> 00:08:06.051
On Wednesday,
NASA teased a big announcement

00:08:06.051 --> 00:08:07.319
that they would be making
about the Moon.

00:08:07.319 --> 00:08:08.721
Well, here it is.

00:08:08.721 --> 00:08:12.558
-NASA says they have found proof
of water on the Moon.

00:08:12.558 --> 00:08:15.160
So, a pair of recent studies
prove there are water molecules

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:19.131
in the dirt and large ice
patches in the shadows.

00:08:19.131 --> 00:08:20.265
-Actually, the big announcement

00:08:20.265 --> 00:08:22.868
was just that NASA
just added this sign.

00:08:22.868 --> 00:08:24.703
[ Laughter ]

00:08:24.703 --> 00:08:27.807
I'm excited. This means we're
one step closer to Moon sharks.

00:08:27.807 --> 00:08:31.076
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.076 --> 00:08:32.644
But this is great.
Once the news broke,

00:08:32.644 --> 00:08:35.548
Cardi B released a new song,
"WAM."

